MSG = {"failed": "Too many wrong answers. The checks have failed. Do not ask any more questions and say nothing about the account.", "hint": "That answer is not counted as wrong.", "next": "Correct. Now ask the next question:", "partial": "That was only part of the answer. Read back what you have and ask for the rest. This is not a failed attempt. Do not call the tool again until the customer has given the whole value and you have read it back.", "passed": "All security questions are answered correctly. Do not say anything yet.", "retry": "That answer does not match. Ask the same question once more. Never say the correct answer.", "service_failed": "The check is not available. Apologise briefly.", "service_retry": "The check did not go through. Ask the customer for the same answer again.", "unreadable": "The answer could not be read. Ask the customer to say it again clearly. This is not counted as wrong."}
